{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-message-p7469","chapterId":"s75bb686dcfcdfb54","language":"zh-CN","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-message-p7469-49a212efa081295194e4","text":"嘿","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-f72ed954fd932251dc69","text":"好厉害，梦里也可以发消息！","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-d4b43113c57a2a0ae545","text":"你到了嘛","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-c26fcdae8b48ce1aa6be","text":"我到了。","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-44be431c33c677da7c5a","text":"我到了","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-e9594b0bf13e21a75a79","text":"我没到。","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-3ed6c5a6350096efd829","text":"在路上了","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-6e8596590f728336be97","text":"你又骗我:(","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-fe68ead656a9b914e690","text":"刚联系上姬子和杨叔，大家都去了不同的梦境","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-0060a288419757f27768","text":"我在薄暮的时刻！准备去拍卖会看看","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-8cebe63a979f343012fe","text":"再会合也麻烦，不如先分头行动吧","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-251b8fc8b4d540d0ca8c","text":"你在黄金的时刻？听说那里的「梦境贩售店」很出名","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-83b88c16b02b172dcb95","text":"帮我打个卡呗，要是好玩，下一站就去你那儿！","speaker":"三月七"}]}
